 to bachelorette fun, a little organization goes a LONG way!\n\n3\ufe0f\u20e3 Keep your energy up. Trust me, wedding days are marathons! Pack snacks, hydrate, and sneak in a good night\u2019s sleep.\n\n4\ufe0f\u20e3 Take ALL the behind-the-scenes photos. The bride will cherish the candid moments you capture.\n\n5\ufe0f\u20e3 Be a problem solver. Is the bouquet missing? Find it. Did someone forget safety pins? You\u2019re on it. Channel your inner wedding ninja!\n\n\ud83d\udc90 Cheers to all the amazing #Bridesmaids and #MaidsOfHonour out there making wedding dreams come true! Drop your own tips in the comments! \ud83d\udc47\n\n#WeddingTips #MaidOfHonourDuties #BridesmaidTips #WilsonEverAfter #WeddingInspo #BridalSquadGoals #WeddingDayMagic #weddingtips #weddinginspiration\">\n        <\/a>\n    <\/div>\n<\/div><div class=\"sbi_item sbi_type_carousel sbi_new sbi_transition\" id=\"sbi_17854129047329323\" data-date=\"1732487387\">\n    <div class=\"sbi_photo_wrap\">\n        <a class=\"sbi_photo\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DCxVsDTKgde\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" data-full-res=\"https:\/\/scontent-jnb2-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.75761-15\/468073023_18377347579107169_718482380217230962_n.jpg?_nc_cat=104&#038;ccb=1-7&#038;_nc_sid=18de74&#038;_nc_ohc=zGrnLt6YHOMQ7kNvgEE9Gjt&#038;_nc_zt=23&#038;_nc_ht=scontent-jnb2-1.cdninstagram.com&#038;edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&#038;_nc_gid=A67thKmnpWSnKwTpLRaZJpV&#038;oh=00_AYBEMxwfexZcy2GtiITCTJguzknlaqgYgzCQVWJybKLpdg&#038;oe=6756885F\" data-img-src-set=\"{&quot;d&quot;:&quot;https:\\\/\\\/scontent-jnb2-1.cdninstagram.com\\\/v\\\/t51.75761-15\\\/468073023_18377347579107169_718482380217230962_n.jpg?_nc_cat=104&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=18de74&amp;_nc_ohc=zGrnLt6YHOMQ7kNvgEE9Gjt&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-jnb2-1.cdninstagram.com&amp;edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=A67thKmnpWSnKwTpLRaZJpV&amp;oh=00_AYBEMxwfexZcy2GtiITCTJguzknlaqgYgzCQVWJybKLpdg&amp;oe=6756885F&quot;,&quot;150&quot;:&quot;https:\\\/\\\/scontent-j