h fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M424.4 214.7L72.4 6.6C43.8-10.3 0 6.1 0 47.9V464c0 37.5 40.7 60.1 72.4 41.3l352-208c31.4-18.5 31.5-64.1 0-82.6z\"><\/path><\/svg>            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/discoverwithleigh.co.za\/wp-content\/plugins\/instagram-feed\/img\/placeholder.png\" alt=\"TIPS BELOW \u2b07\ufe0f\u2026. \ud83c\udf1f\ud83d\udc8d What an unforgettable experience being the Maid of Honour at my sister\u2019s wedding! \ud83d\udc95 Watching her say \u201cI do\u201d to my now brother-in-law was pure magic. \u2728 I loved every moment of being by her side\u2014and learned a few things along the way!\n\nHere are my Top 5 Tips for Being the BEST Maid of Honour or Bridesmaid:\n\n1\ufe0f\u20e3 Be the bride\u2019s calm in the chaos. Whether it\u2019s helping her find her something blue or hyping her up before the walk down the aisle, your job is to keep her cool and confident.\n\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 Plan ahead. From the dress fittings to bachelorette fun, a little organization goes a LONG way!\n\n3\ufe0f\u20e3 Keep your energy up. Trust me, wedding days are marathons! Pack snacks, hydrate, and sneak in a good night\u2019s sleep.\n\n4\ufe0f\u20e3 Take ALL the behind-the-scenes photos. The bride will cherish the candid moments you capture.\n\n5\ufe0f\u20e3 Be a problem solver. Is the bouquet missing? Find it. Did someone forget safety pins? You\u2019re on it. Channel your inner wedding ninja!\n\n\ud83d\udc90 Cheers to all the amazing #Bridesmaids and #MaidsOfHonour out there making wedding dreams come true! Drop your own tips in the comments! \ud83d\udc47\n\n#WeddingTips #MaidOfHonourDuties #BridesmaidTips #WilsonEverAfter #WeddingInspo #BridalSquadGoals #WeddingDayMagic #weddingtips #weddinginspiration\">\n        <\/a>\n    <\/div>\n<\/div><div class=\"sbi_item sbi_type_carousel sbi_new sbi_transition\" id=\"sbi_17854129047329323\" data-date=\"1732487387\">\n    <div class=\"sbi_photo_wrap\">\n        <a class=\"sbi_photo\" href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\